[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 21241.19, "timestamp": "05:54:01", "text": "你需要带上那些东西，就像烹饪一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21243.35, "timestamp": "05:54:03", "text": "餐具。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21245.51, "timestamp": "05:54:05", "text": "那液态咖喱之类的东西呢？做"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21248.39, "timestamp": "05:54:08", "text": "你得到液体液体之类的东西，或者类似的东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21251.19, "timestamp": "05:54:11", "text": "例如，假设你在吃东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21253.59, "timestamp": "05:54:13", "text": "印度的大米之类的东西？不。如果是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21256.628, "timestamp": "05:54:16", "text": "只吃米饭的话，你会感觉有点奇怪。不，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21259.03, "timestamp": "05:54:19", "text": "但这就是为什么人们要吃桑巴尔汤的原因。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21260.948, "timestamp": "05:54:20", "text": "其他事情，对吧？像液态咖喱"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21265.03, "timestamp": "05:54:25", "text": "以及所有的一切。所以在日本，我知道"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21266.948, "timestamp": "05:54:26", "text": "因为米饭是糯米，所以是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21269.67, "timestamp": "05:54:29", "text": "握持方便，一切都很好。是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21272.47, "timestamp": "05:54:32", "text": "然后他们会放上配料之类的东西，比如"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21274.628, "timestamp": "05:54:34", "text": "鸡蛋之类的东西，对吧？那么，情况又如何呢？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21277.03, "timestamp": "05:54:37", "text": "液体？有什么液体可以吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21279.03, "timestamp": "05:54:39", "text": "放？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21282.548, "timestamp": "05:54:42", "text": "嗯，我的意思是，我觉得你可以找到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21286.708, "timestamp": "05:54:46", "text": "咖喱，比如咖喱和咖喱包。你可以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21290.11, "timestamp": "05:54:50", "text": "把那东西煮沸，然后放在上面。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21293.67, "timestamp": "05:54:53", "text": "像日式咖喱一样的米饭。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21297.628, "timestamp": "05:54:57", "text": "此外，还有印度商店之类的。"}]